{
  "faed99642daf": {
    "title": "STATUS CO · STATUS-CO",
    "description": "STATUS CO was built from nothing, entirely through digital means, and every part of it had to sit under one language. The website carries that logic. The first drop lives on the site as a spatial copy of the pop-up itself: every object modelled in 3D at true scale, optimised for the web, placed exactly where it stood. Visitors who came to the event can walk the room again and catch the details they missed standing in it. Click an object and it opens its photographs, its specs, the thinking behind it. The site introduces the brand and runs as a live digital twin of the space at the same time.",
