  "84f19d715478": {
    "title": "Decentralize Design · decentralize design",
    "description": "Built together with the Milan based digital design studio, the site holds their entire output inside a single UI frame and delivers it piece by piece. The structure was approached architecturally, sections flowing into one another in a clear hierarchy, so the site reads like a building you move through floor by floor.",
